00:18:19,309 --> 00:18:21,769
just escaped the Ryugu Palace!

261
00:18:22,269 --> 00:18:23,569
Who gives a damn?

262
00:18:25,649 --> 00:18:27,909
Once I get rid of this annoyance,

263
00:18:27,909 --> 00:18:30,289
I'll only have to deal with a feeble old fool

264
00:18:30,289 --> 00:18:31,949
and his helpless ma.

265
00:18:35,129 --> 00:18:36,589
Shorkaroos!

266
00:18:38,929 --> 00:18:48,009
Nami-Chin, should we have left the others behind like that?

267
00:18:48,009 --> 00:18:50,749
If anyone else tried to come, we would have been caught.

268
00:18:50,749 --> 00:18:52,809
Seemed like they were in trouble, though.

269
00:18:52,809 --> 00:18:54,249
Those guys are fine.

270
00:18:54,249 --> 00:18:56,949
Don't worry, they always make it out alive somehow.

271
00:18:56,949 --> 00:18:58,949
Yeah...

272
00:18:58,949 --> 00:19:01,109
I mean, I know they're tough and all.

273
00:19:03,149 --> 00:19:05,789
But there's something scary about Hordy.

274
00:19:05,789 --> 00:19:08,489
Ha-Chin said he's strong, but more than that,

275
00:19:08,489 --> 00:19:10,489
he's cruel and ruthless.

276
00:19:12,489 --> 00:19:13,569
They can handle it.

277
00:19:13,569 --> 00:19:16,569
They've grown stronger by leaps and bounds these past few years.

278
00:19:16,569 --> 00:19:17,569
That aside,

279
00:19:17,569 --> 00:19:20,909
can you tell me what this former warlord, Jinbei, is like?

280
00:19:20,909 --> 00:19:21,569
Huh?

281
00:19:21,569 --> 00:19:23,029
Oh, well...

282
00:19:23,029 --> 00:19:30,109
It's true he's a pirate, but he's well-trusted on the island, and they respect him enough that he can visit the palace, too.

283
00:19:30,109 --> 00:19:32,109
Really? That's interesting.

284
00:19:32,109 --> 00:19:34,909
Especially since he was a part of Arlong's crew.

285
00:19:34,909 --> 00:19:40,109
And now this Hordy guy is presenting himself like the second coming of Arlong.

286
00:19:40,109 --> 00:19:44,189
And Jinbei made a point to warn Luffy not to fight him.

287
00:19:44,189 --> 00:19:46,889
And now I'm pretty sure I know why that is.

288
00:19:46,889 --> 00:19:49,269
Huh? He was trying to keep him safe, right?

289
00:19:49,269 --> 00:19:54,349
Just in case, let's keep our fingers crossed that Zoro and the others don't push Hordy too far.

290
00:19:54,349 --> 00:19:58,429
No matter what, though, I want to meet this Jinbei guy.

291
00:19:58,429 --> 00:20:01,229
He's waiting for Luffy at the sea forest now, right?

292
00:20:01,229 --> 00:20:03,589
We're a part of this, whether we like it or not.

293
00:20:03,589 --> 00:20:08,989
The whole kingdom could topple, but I don't know anything about the history behind Hordy and his pirate crew.

294
00:20:08,989 --> 00:20:11,669
I bet Jinbei could help us decide how to handle this.

295
00:20:11,669 --> 00:20:13,309
Wait, do you really think so?

296
00:20:13,309 --> 00:20:14,309
Kami.

297
00:20:16,309 --> 00:20:18,349
I need to get to the sea forest.

298
00:20:18,349 --> 00:20:19,349
Right.

299
00:20:19,349 --> 00:20:32,629
Listen up, soldiers.

300
00:20:32,629 --> 00:20:36,629
Sir, we swear we'll take care of Hordy and the rest of his crew immediately.

301
00:20:36,629 --> 00:20:38,069
No, you won't.

302
00:20:38,069 --> 00:20:39,069
Huh?

303
00:20:39,069 --> 00:20:44,149
I'm too weak to give you my full assistance, and I can't let you sacrifice your lives like that.

304
00:20:44,149 --> 00:20:48,749
We shall surrender the palace for the time being, and meet up with Fukaboshi.

305
00:20:48,749 --> 00:20:51,749
