308
00:20:54,349 --> 00:20:56,989
We can't let the palace fall to this evil scum.

309
00:20:56,989 --> 00:20:57,989
Damn it, Zoro.

310
00:20:57,989 --> 00:21:01,469
I know you're strong, but do you really think you can beat a fish man in the water?

311
00:21:01,469 --> 00:21:02,829
